# Imagem para rodar o GDE localmente com "docker compose up" - nao e a
# imagem de producao (essa fica em Dockerfile, que nao entra no espelho
# publico do github). Ve docker-compose.yml.

FROM php:8.5-apache

RUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y \
    libpng-dev \
    libjpeg62-turbo-dev \
    libonig-dev \
    libzip-dev \
    libcurl4-openssl-dev \
    unzip \
    default-mysql-client \
    && docker-php-ext-configure gd --with-jpeg \
    && docker-php-ext-install pdo_mysql mysqli mbstring gd zip curl bcmath \
    && a2enmod rewrite \
    && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*

# Permite .htaccess (o app usa mod_rewrite para as URLs)
RUN sed -ri -e 's!AllowOverride None!AllowOverride All!g' /etc/apache2/apache2.conf

COPY --from=composer:2 /usr/bin/composer /usr/bin/composer

WORKDIR /var/www/html

COPY . .

COPY common/config-docker.inc.php common/config.inc.php

RUN composer install --no-interaction --optimize-autoloader

RUN mkdir -p cache/arvores cache/dac_results proxies \
    && chown -R www-data:www-data cache proxies \
    && chmod -R 775 cache proxies
